; Room 16 ($10): We must perform a Quirkafleeg
;
; Format: see #R$C000.
; .
; Border: red (2). Conveyor: none. Ramp: 1 cells from row 9 column 4 up to row
; 9 column 4, rising to the left.
; .
; Items (from the item table at #R$A400): 1, at row 4 column 31.
; .
; Exits: left Room 17 (Up on the Battlements, #R$D100); right Room 15 (I'm
; sure I've seen this before.., #R$CF00); up Room 50 (Watch Tower, #R$F200);
; down Room 0 (The Off Licence, #R$C000).
; .
; Entities: slot 0: definition $0D (at $A068) start $08; slot 1: definition
; $01 (at $A008) start $10; slot 2: definition $3C (at $A1E0) start $84. List
; ends at slot 3 ($FF).
@label=RoomQuirkafleeg
